{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic-settings/pulls/1109","id":5043695145,"node_id":"PR_kwDOH8_sKs8AAAABLKCuKQ","html_url":"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-settings/pull/1109","diff_url":"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-settings/pull/1109.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-settings/pull/1109.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic-settings/issues/1109","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic-settings/pulls/1109/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic-settings/pulls/1109/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic-settings/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic-settings/issues/1109/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic-settings/statuses/74c01ae3e84f9c8f2b04ec269e67813abd96cf9a","number":1109,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix JSON decoding of nested dictionary environment values","user":{"login":"Hugohong258","id":282228220,"node_id":"U_kgDOENJ1_A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282228220?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hugohong258","html_url":"https://github.com/Hugohong258","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hugohong258/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hugohong258/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hugohong258/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hugohong258/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hugohong258/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hugohong258/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hugohong258/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hugohong258/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hugohong258/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"For `dict[str, list[dict[str, str]]]`, an environment value such as `APP_VALUES__X='[{\"k\":\"v\"}]'` reaches validation as a string. `next_field()` descends into the dictionary's type arguments before recognizing the dictionary itself, losing the value's container type. Handle the outer dictionary first so the value is decoded at the correct nesting level. Fixes #1107.\n\nThree new cases fail on the base and one control passes. With the change, the settings module passes 515 tests with 7 skips on Windows/Python 3.12.3; settings and nested-secret tests pass 577 with 1 skip on Linux/Python 3.14.4. Repository-wide Ruff lint/format and mypy (22 library files) pass using the lockfile tools. The broader Windows unit run excluding documentation examples has 1,276 passes, 11 skips and 6 failures while creating symlinks (WinError 1314); these cases pass in the Linux selection. Documentation examples and the full OS/interpreter matrix were not run.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:27:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T09:55:48Z","closed_at":"2026-10-28T09:55:47Z","merged_at":"2026-10-28T09:55:47Z","merge_commit_sha":"9e02de082f68e3115f378efaa0c91d0bfcb66dec","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Hugohong258:fix-nested-dict-env-decoding","ref":"fix-nested-dict-env-decoding","repo":{"id":1436467394,"node_id":"R_kgDOVZ7Awg","name":"pydantic-settings","full_name":"Hugohong258/pydantic-settings","owner":{"login":"Hugohong258","id":282228220,"node_id":"U_kgDOENJ1_A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282228220?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hugohong258","html_url":"https://github.com/Hugohong258","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hugohong258/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hugohong258/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hugohong258/g